OL,3,GNEWSATrain CCTV shows victims 'fighting
OL,4,Afor their lives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV footage of a mass train stabbing
OL,7,Fshows victims "hand-to-hand fighting"
OL,8,Fand "literally fighting for their
OL,9,Flives", a court has heard.
OL,11,FOn the second day of a trial at
OL,12,FCambridge Crown Court, prosecutor
OL,13,FChristopher Paxton KC told jurors how
OL,14,Fpassengers on the Doncaster to King's
OL,15,FCross train had "stood tall against the
OL,16,Fdefendant's onslaught".
OL,18,FJurors also heard how one victim
OL,19,Fthought he would die, but was saved by
OL,20,Fhis dog who "sent the defendant running
OL,21,Foff".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
