OL,3,GNEWSATrain CCTV shows victims 'fighting
OL,4,Afor their lives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthony Williams, 33, denies 14 counts
OL,7,Fof attempted murder in relation to an
OL,8,Fattack on a London-bound LNER train
OL,9,Fbetween Peterborough and Huntingdon on
OL,10,F1 November 2025, and incidents in
OL,11,FPeterborough and London the day before.
